            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "sugarmagnolia98"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The taste of this was ok- just like a sweet bread- and it was easy to make. It didn't have the texture of the stuffing I'm used to (separated cubes of moist bread). It baked into a solid piece which we cut into squares to serve. I won't make it again - but it wasn't horrible - just nothing special.",
            "datePublished": "2008-06-10T16:09:10.590Z"
